  "description": "A fluent, zero-dependency .NET library that generates linear (1D) barcodes and 2D codes: Code 128, GS1-128, Code 39, EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A (with EAN-2/EAN-5 add-ons), QR codes, Data Matrix and PDF417, with human-readable text, styled QR codes (rounded modules, gradients, logos) and a DI-friendly IBarcodeGenerator. Outputs PNG, JPEG, SVG, byte arrays, streams, base64 and data URIs.",
